  "description": "NASFOE crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C56 H72 Eu2 Mn2 N12 O14,C2 H3 N1. From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors; Mn1 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors; Eu1B (Eu) has 6 O neighbors; Mn1B (Mn) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.290-3.589 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.48-111.76°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [MnIII2EuIII2(hmp)6(μ-N3)2(piv)4]·2CH3CN. Article name explicitly identifies Mn(III), Eu(III).",
